    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANDY: Hello? Anybody home?\nANDY: Hi, Joanie...\nJOAN: Oh great.\nANDY: I just got in from Hawaii and thought I'd drop by for a minute. What the heck happened in here?",
      "JOAN: Socorro!! Wait a minute! I want to talk to you! The Low-Rider comes to a stop. Joan approaches the pas- senger window and leans down to Soco…\nJOAN: Excuse me, Socorro, but do you mind if I ask what's happening, why are you leaving?\nSOCORRO: No se, lo siento.\nJOAN: I'm asking, where-are-you-going?",
      "JOAN: Monday? But this is Thursday, I can't stay here alone 'til Monday.\nJOAN SOCORRO: It's my understanding Si, lunes, lunes. that Socorro lived here, otherwise, I would've made other plans.",
      "JOAN: Please leave a message after the tone... Thank you.\nANDY: Joan? It's Andy... Are you there? I want to inform you that these people are drugging me...",
      "JOAN: Andy, tell me the name of the hospital you checked yourself into.\nANDY: Mount Haven, it's in the South Bay, and don't ask me these inane questions, just do something..."
    ]
